// REQUIRES: host-linux-amd64 || host-linux-arm64
// RUN: rm -rf %t.d
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/runner-scenarios.py cleanup --signal TERM --work %t.d --programs %S/Inputs/runner
// P04.19 (R6): `gopp test-run` stopped by SIGTERM (SIGINT: runner-cleanup-int.test; a cancelled lit
// run, `timeout`) removes the temporary directory of its objects and output
// files and ends with 128 + the signal, with a program (loop.gopp) running.
